Subject: [PATCH 1/4] drm/msm/a8xx: Add missing a850 ifpc reglist entries

We want to save/restore all of the CP_PROTECT regs across IFPC.

Tested-by: Alexander Koskovich <akoskovich@pm.me> # Milos (Nothing Phone 3a)
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Akhil P Oommen <akhilpo@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261109142111.256630-6-robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com
[ from the linux-arm-msm archive: v8 05/15 of "drm/msm/a8xx: GPU state capture support" (9 Nov 2026); not applied upstream yet ]
[ upstream author: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>; picked for the iceland kernel q92d (applies unchanged) ]
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_catalog.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_catalog.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_catalog.c
index 7540e3aede08c..6e169f1f900ad 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_catalog.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_catalog.c
@@ -914,6 +914,13 @@ static const u32 a850_ifpc_reglist_regs[] = {
 	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(53),
 	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(54),
 	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(55),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(56),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(57),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(58),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(59),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(60),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(61),
+	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(62),
 	REG_A8XX_CP_PROTECT_GLOBAL(63),
 };
 DECLARE_ADRENO_REGLIST_LIST(a850_ifpc_reglist);
